  "prefLabel": "Plc 801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 801.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 327-A relative to regulating the profession of ophthalmic dispensing, by establishing requirements for:\n\n(a) Obtaining and renewing a certificate of registration to practice ophthalmic dispensing in New Hampshire;\n\n(b) Obtaining the reinstatement of a certificate of registration to practice ophthalmic dispensing that has expired or been suspended or revoked; and\n\n(c) The regulation of the practices of registered ophthalmic dispensers, including ethical and professional standards required to be met by registrants.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc800.html"
}
